{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123185259731-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123190038\"/><p>今午(23日)3時18分，新蒲崗大有街一銀行職員報案，指懷疑有人以一張面值100美元的偽鈔存款。警員接報到場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕一名姓孫(47歲)本地女子，她現正被扣留調查。警員正調查涉案偽鈔的來源。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:33:25.656171+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:52:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:37:11.001279+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:26:48.326454+00:00","content_hash":"83c86753a8b83d05372fbabff9d71ecc93c0da7d7270a0e5800cabe1e17afc44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:33:25.656171+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}